    {
      "locator": "p:44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "业务规则",
      "style": "4",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "业务规则"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1、SOW首页展示所有人创建的SOW，可以按照名称、关联商机、状态、创建人、期望完成时间等条件快速查询；",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "1、SOW首页展示所有人创建的SOW，可以按照名称、关联商机、状态、创建人、期望完成时间等条件快速查询；"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2、SOW状态说明：",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "2、SOW状态说明："
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "已注册：SOW创建完成即【已注册】，可编辑、提交（完成）、删除；",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "已注册：SOW创建完成即【已注册】，可编辑、提交（完成）、删除；"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "已完成：SOW完成基本信息及SOW清单的上传，提交完成，修改状态为【已完成】，可编辑、删除；",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "已完成：SOW完成基本信息及SOW清单的上传，提交完成，修改状态为【已完成】，可编辑、删除；"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "已登记：SOW关联的方案评审通过，修改状态为【已登记】，不可编辑/删除。",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "已登记：SOW关联的方案评审通过，修改状态为【已登记】，不可编辑/删除。"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "新建SOW",
      "style": "3",
      "isHeading": false,
