    {
      "locator": "p:57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "业务规则",
      "style": "4",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "业务规则"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1、用户在SOW首页列表点击“新建SOW”，进入新建SOW侧滑面板，用户输入基本信息，可提交创建：",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "1、用户在SOW首页列表点击“新建SOW”，进入新建SOW侧滑面板，用户输入基本信息，可提交创建："
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "SOW名称：中文/英文，最多30个字",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": true,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "SOW名称：中文/英文，最多30个字"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "关联商机：文本格式，最多30个字",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": true,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "关联商机：文本格式，最多30个字"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "商机编号：文本格式，最多30个字",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": true,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "商机编号：文本格式，最多30个字"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "SOW类型（单选）：POC、交付、FM1、其他",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": true,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "SOW类型（单选）：POC、交付、FM1、其他"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "产品类型（单选）：业务产品、平台产品、工具产品",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": true,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "产品类型（单选）：业务产品、平台产品、工具产品"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "期望完成时间：年月日选择器",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": true,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "期望完成时间：年月日选择器"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "凭据附件：上传附件，支持上传图片、文件格式的附件",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": true,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "凭据附件：上传附件，支持上传图片、文件格式的附件"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "SOW描述：富文本",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": true,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "SOW描述：富文本"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "操作：",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": true,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "操作："
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "取消：关闭弹窗；",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "取消：关闭弹窗；"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "仅创建：创建SOW，关闭弹窗；",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "仅创建：创建SOW，关闭弹窗；"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "创建，并继续设计：创建SOW，进入SOW编辑页面，继续上传SOW清单。",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "创建，并继续设计：创建SOW，进入SOW编辑页面，继续上传SOW清单。"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "编辑SOW",
      "style": "3",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "编辑SOW"
