    },
    {
      "locator": "p:117",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1、用户在SOW列表点击“删除”，校验当前SOW是否关联方案：",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "1、用户在SOW列表点击“删除”，校验当前SOW是否关联方案："
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:118",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "（1）如果当前SOW未关联方案，显示【删除弹窗】，确认删除后删除SOW；",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "（1）如果当前SOW未关联方案，显示【删除弹窗】，确认删除后删除SOW；"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:119",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "（2）如果当前 SOW已经关联了方案，则不允许删除，提示“当前SOW已关联方案【XXXXX方案名称】，不允许删除。”",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "（2）如果当前 SOW已经关联了方案，则不允许删除，提示“当前SOW已关联方案【XXXXX方案名称】，不允许删除。”"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:120",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "（3）方案名称支持点击，点击后新开页面查看方案详情。",
      "style": "",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "（3）方案名称支持点击，点击后新开页面查看方案详情。"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:121",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "提交完成",
      "style": "3",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "提交完成"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:122",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "功能描述",
      "style": "4",
      "isHeading": false,
      "headingLevel": null,
      "isNumbered": false,
      "sectionPath": [],
      "displayLocation": "文档正文",
      "quote": "功能描述"
    },
    {
      "locator": "p:123",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "用户可以通过该功能进行SOW的提交，修改SOW状态进入已完成。已完成的SOW可以被方案关联。",
      "style": "",
